# Every receiver here is built by a vendor toolchain that writes its output
# beside the source: Gradle for Android TV, roku-deploy for Roku, npm for the
# web-hosted shells. None of it is a deliverable -- the deliverables are the
# source, the manifests and the fixtures -- and all of it is large enough that
# committing it once buries the tree it was added to.
node_modules/
dist/
build/
out/
.gradle/

# Packaged receiver bundles, produced from the sources beside them.
*.ipk
*.wgt
*.apk
*.pkg
